== Purpose of the use of AI

ChatGPT was used to recommend papers for background information, debugging the analysis code, suggest organization of background information, and correcting minor spelling and phrashing errors. I personally read through the suggested papers and checked the debugged code. ChatGPT had no part in the designing the analysis pipeline or the interpretations of the results. 

== Parts of this work,  where AI was used

Layout, order of presented information, and minor corrected spellings throughout the entire document.
